build/
toolchain/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# data/: the game's Data folder. data/db (the tables and the rules documents) and data/ai (the computer players'
# scripts) are tracked; the media under it (Models, Textures, Sounds, ...; tools/fetch_data.py unpacks them from the
# releases, data/.fetched.json lists them) and the saved games the game writes there stay out.
/data/*
!/data/db/
!/data/ai/
rust/target/
